# This build has no backend: no database, no accounts, no sessions. Nothing
# here is required — the app runs correctly with no .env at all.

# Optional: enables the live Google Map on /map. Leave blank to use the static
# fallback. This ships to the browser by design — restrict it by HTTP referrer
# in the Google Cloud console. That restriction is its only real protection.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=""

# Optional: the address shown on the privacy page for data questions. If unset
# the page says so plainly rather than printing a fake-looking address.
PRIVACY_CONTACT_EMAIL=""
